  - m_Id: 471890269757440
    m_Localized: "An anomalous deep-sea creature signature\u2014never before documented\u2014has
      been detected within capturable range between Z-coordinates -25 and 25. A torpedo
      made a direct hit, but the contact reappeared 5 minutes later. The capture
      equipment currently onboard may not be sufficient to handle it. Requesting
      formal capture authorization and a support submarine equipped with additional
      capture gear."
